hadiths[60]{hadithnumber,text}:
"77","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Banu Anmar ki jang mein Apni sawari par namaz padh rahe the jabke Aap ka rukh mashriq ki taraf tha."
"78","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Yasar (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdullah bin Umar ke sath Makkah ke raste mein chal raha tha. Sa'id kehte hain: Phir jab mujhe Fajr ka andesha hua to main utra aur witr padha. To unhon ne kaha: Kya tumhare liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mein namuna nahin hai? Main ne kaha: Kyun nahin, Allah ki qasam. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) oont par witr padhte the."
"79","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko gadhe par namaz padhte dekha jabke Aap Khaibar ki taraf mutawajjah the."
"80","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) safar mein Apni sawari par namaz padhte jidhar bhi woh Aap ko le jati. Abdullah bin Dinar kehte hain: Aur Abdullah bin Umar aisa hi karte the."
"81","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jama'at ki namaz akele ki namaz se sattais darje fazeelat rakhti hai.'"
"82","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jama'at ki namaz tum mein se kisi ki akele namaz se pachees hisson se afzal hai.'"
"83","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Khaibar mein the aur Banu Ghifar ka ek aadmi logon ki imamat kar raha tha; main ne use Subah ki namaz mein pehli rak'at mein Surah Maryam, aur dusri mein padhte suna: [Jab] main Madinah aaya ﴿وَيْلٌ لِلْمُطَفِّفِينَ﴾ [ke sath]. Jabke hamare paas ek aadmi tha jis ke paas do paimane the: Woh ek se leta aur dusre se deta tha. To main ne kaha: Falan ke liye halakat hai."
"84","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughirah bin Shu'bah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) [raat ki namaz mein] khade hote yahan tak ke Aap ke dono qadam sooj jate. To kaha gaya: Kya Allah ne Aap ke agle pichhle gunah bakhsh nahin diye hain? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya main shukr guzar banda na banun.'"
"85","[AI-translation] Hazrat Qutbah bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Fajr mein ﴿وَالنَّخْلَ بَاسِقَاتٍ﴾ padhte suna."
"86","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jubair bin Mut'im (Raziyallahu anhu) se apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Maghrib mein At-Tur padhte suna."
"87","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jubair bin Mut'im (Raziyallahu anhu) se apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Maghrib mein At-Tur padhte suna."
"88","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Ummul-Fazl bint Haris ne unhen suna jabke woh ﴿وَالْمُرْسَلَاتِ عُرْفًا﴾ padh rahe the. To unhon ne kaha: Ai mere bete, beshak tum ne Apni is qiraat se mujhe yeh surat yaad dila di; beshak yeh aakhri [surat] hai jo main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Maghrib mein padhte suna."
"89","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se apni walida Ummul-Fazl [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Maghrib mein use: Al-Mursalat padhte suna."
"90","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara bin Azib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath [Atamah, Isha ki] namaz padhi, to Aap ne us mein At-Teen waz-Zaitun padhi."
"91","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara bin Azib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne use khabar di ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Isha padhi, to Aap ne us mein At-Teen waz-Zaitun padhi."
"92","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Waqid Laisi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un se poocha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Azha aur Fitr [ki namazon] mein kya padhte the? Unhon ne kaha: Aap Qaf wal-Quranil-Majeed, aur Iqtarabatis-Sa'ah wanshaqqal-Qamar padhte the."
"93","[AI-translation] Zirr bin Hubaysh (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ubayy bin Ka'b se Mu'awwizatain ke bare mein poocha, phir main ne un se kaha: Beshak tumhare bhai Ibn Mas'ud inhen mushaf se mitate hain. To unhon ne kaha: Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha, to Aap ne farmaya: Mujh se kaha gaya [Jibreel ke zariye: Kaho], to main ne kaha [jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kaha]. To ham bhi wahi kehte hain jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kaha."
"94","[AI-translation] Bakr bin Abdullah Muzani (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main ne [khwab mein] dekha goya ek aadmi Quran likh raha hai; jab woh [surah] Suad wale sajde par se guzra to ek darakht ne sajda kiya aur kaha: Ai Allah, mujhe is ke badle ajr de, is ke badle bojh utar, ya is ke badle shukr paida farma. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'To ham darakht se zyada sajde ke haqdar hain.' Phir Aap ne use sajda kiya aur us mein sajde ka hukm diya."
"95","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas An-Najm padhi, to Aap ne us mein sajda nahin farmaya."
"96","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne An-Najm padhi aur us mein sajda farmaya; aur log Aap ke sath sajde mein gae siwae do aadmiyon ke. Ravi kehte hain: Unhon ne shohrat chahi [taake pehchane jayen]."
"97","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Abu Hurairah ne unhen Izas-Sama'unshaqqat padh kar sunai aur us mein sajda kiya. Jab [namaz se] phire to unhen khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us mein sajda farmaya tha."
"98","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath [qiraat] Izas-Sama'unshaqqat mein sajda kiya."
"99","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman (Rahimahullah) se Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne unhen dekha ke woh [qiraat] Izas-Sama'unshaqqat mein sajda kar rahe hain. Abu Salamah kehte hain: Jab [namaz se] phire to main ne un se kaha: Tum ne us surat mein sajda kiya jis mein main ne logon ko sajda karte nahin dekha. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak main, agar main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko us mein sajda karte na dekha hota, to us mein sajda na karta."
"100","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Humaid Sa'idi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ham Aap par durood kaise bhejen? To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kaho: Allahumma salli ala Muhammad wa azwajihi wa zurriyyatihi kama sallaita ala aali Ibrahim, wa barik ala Muhammad wa azwajihi wa zurriyyatihi kama barakta ala aali Ibrahim, innaka hamidum-majeed [Ai Allah, Muhammad, Un ki azwaj aur Un ki zurriyyat par rehmat farma jaise Tun ne aal Ibrahim par rehmat farmai; aur Muhammad, Un ki azwaj aur Un ki zurriyyat par barkat farma jaise Tun ne aal Ibrahim par barkat farmai; beshak Tu nihayat qabil tareef, buzurg hai].'"
"101","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamare paas Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Sa'd bin Ubadah ki majlis mein tashreef lae. To Bashir bin Sa'd ne Aap se kaha: Allah Azz wa Jall ne ham ko hukm diya hai ke ham Aap par durood bhejen, Ya Rasulullah; to ham Aap par durood kaise bhejen? Ravi kehte hain: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khamosh rahe yahan tak ke ham ne tamanna ki ke kash us ne Aap se na poocha hota. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kaho: Allahumma salli ala Muhammad wa ala aali Muhammad kama sallaita ala aali Ibrahim, wa barik ala Muhammad wa ala aali Muhammad kama barakta ala aali Ibrahim fil-alameen, innaka hamidum-majeed [Ai Allah, Muhammad aur aal Muhammad par rehmat farma jaise Tun ne aal Ibrahim par rehmat farmai; aur Muhammad aur aal Muhammad par barkat farma jaise Tun ne tamam jahanon mein aal Ibrahim par barkat farmai; beshak Tu nihayat qabil tareef, buzurg hai].'"
"102","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abd Qari (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Main ne Hisham bin Hakeem bin Hizam ko Surah Furqan padhte suna ghair us ke jaisa main use padhta hun, jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe use padhaya tha. To qareeb tha ke main us par jaldi karun, phir main ne use mohlat di yahan tak ke woh [namaz se] phira. Phir main use lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, beshak main ne is ko Surah Furqan padhte suna ghair us ke jaisa Aap ne mujhe padhaya tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: 'Padho.' To us ne woh qiraat padhi jo main ne use padhte suna tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Isi tarah nazil hui hai.' Phir mujh se farmaya: 'Padho.' To main ne padha, phir farmaya: 'Isi tarah nazil hui hai. Beshak yeh Quran saat harfon [lehjon] par nazil hua hai; to us mein se jo aasan ho padho.'"
"103","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Quran wale ki misal bandhi hui oontni wale ki tarah hai; agar woh us ki dekh bhal kare to use rok le; aur agar use chhor de to woh chali jati hai.'"
"104","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo qasam khae phir kahe: In sha Allah, to us ne istisna kar liya [tootne par kaffara lazim nahin].'"
"105","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Talhah ke Umm Sulaim se ek beta tha jise Abu Umair kaha jata tha; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab dakhil hote to us se hans mazak farmate. Us ke paas ek chhoti chidiya [nughair] thi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dakhil hue aur Abu Umair ko ghamgeen dekha. To farmaya: 'Abu Umair ka kya mamla hai?' To kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, us ki nughair mar gayi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ai Abu Umair, nughair ne kya kiya?' [narmi se diljoi farmate hue]."
"106","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Saibah (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne ek aadmi se ek oont aariyat liya phir [woh] ayb dar [ya halaak] ho gaya. To use Marwan bin Hakam ke paas laya gaya. To Marwan ne Abu Hurairah ki taraf bheja; unhon ne use [mudda'alaih ko] do safon [sipahiyon] ke darmiyan khada kiya, phir us se poocha. To unhon ne kaha: Woh tawan dega."
"107","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aur jo namaz mein se ek rak'at pa le to beshak us ne [namaz] pa li.'"
"108","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo Subah mein se ek rak'at suraj nikalne se pehle pa le to beshak us ne Subah pa li; aur jo Asr mein se ek rak'at suraj ghurub hone se pehle pa le to beshak us ne Asr pa li.'"
"109","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo namaz mein se ek rak'at pa le to beshak us ne namaz pa li.'"
"110","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pakhane ya peshab ke sath qible ki taraf munh karne se mana farmaya; lekin mashriq ya maghrib ki taraf munh karo. Ravi kehte hain: Phir ham Shaam aae. Ravi kehte hain: To ham ne bait-ul-khala qible ki taraf bane hue paae; to ham [seedhe rukh se] hat jate aur Allah Ta'ala se istighfar karte."
"111","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu), Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahabi se riwayat hai, jab woh Misr mein the, unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, main nahin janta in bait-ul-khalaon ke sath kya karun, jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya hai: 'Jab tum mein se koi pakhane ya peshab ke liye jae to apni sharmgah se qible ki taraf munh na kare aur na peeth kare.'"
"112","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Ansar mein se ek aadmi ne unhen apne walid se khabar di ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko pakhane ya peshab ke liye qible ki taraf munh karne se mana farmate suna."
"113","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, woh kaha karte the: Beshak log kehte hain: Jab tum apni hajat [ke liye] baitho to qible aur na Baitul Maqdis ki taraf munh karo. To Abdullah ne kaha: Beshak main apne ek ghar ki chhat par chadha, phir main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko do eenton par Baitul Maqdis ki taraf munh kiye Apni hajat ke liye [baithe] dekha. Aur unhon ne kaha: 'Shayad tum un mein se ho jo apne koolhon par namaz padhte hain?' Main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, main nahin janta, yani woh jo sajda kare aur zameen se uncha na ho, sajda kare jabke woh zameen se chipka ho. Aur Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Hamare nazdeek Abdullah bin Umar ki hadees Abu Ayyub ki hadees ke khilaf nahin; to jungle mein jo hai us ke liye qible ki taraf munh karna aur peeth karna makrooh hai; kyunke munh aur peeth na karne mein us par koi bojh nahin, aur in dono mein us ke liye koi sahulat nahin. Jab gharon mein bait-ul-khala bana diye jayen to us mein sahulat ke liye jaise mumkin ho wuzu kare; aur main ne is ko is ki tafseer ke sath is jagah ke siwa [dusri jagah] likha hai."
"114","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Ya Rasulullah, beshak main Subah ki namaz se peeche reh jata hun kyunke falan hamare sath [namaz] lambi karta hai. Ravi kehte hain: To main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kisi nasihat mein itna ghussa hote nahin dekha jitna us din. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak tum mein se [deen se] nafrat dilane wale hain; beshak tum mein se nafrat dilane wale hain. To tum mein se jo logon ki imamat kare, [use halka karna chahiye]; kyunke un mein bade, beemar, kamzor aur hajat wale hain.'"
"115","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Khalid ke walid (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Madinah aaya aur Abu Hurairah ke paas thehra; main ne unhen dekha ke woh logon ki imamat karte; unhon ne namaz padhi aur us mein takhfeef ki. To main ne kaha: Ai Abu Hurairah, kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aisi hi namaz padhte the? Unhon ne kaha: Han, aur mukhtasar."
"116","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abdullah bin Umar (Rahimahullah) se apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ham ko takhfeef ka hukm farmate; aur Aap ham ko [Subah mein] As-Saffat ke sath imamat farmate."
"117","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi logon ke sath namaz padhe to takhfeef kare; kyunke un mein beemar, kamzor aur bade hain. Jab tum mein se koi akele namaz padhe to jaise chahe padhe.'"
"118","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman bin Abi Al-Aas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke main logon ki imamat karun, aur unhen un mein se sab se kamzor ke andaze par [namaz padhaon]; kyunke un mein bade, beemar, kamzor aur hajat wale hain."
"119","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab garmi sakht ho jae to namaz ko thanda [Zuhr mein takheer] karo; kyunke garmi ki shiddat Jahannam ki bhaap se hai.' Aap ne farmaya: 'Aur aag ne apne Rabb Azz wa Jall se shikayat ki aur kaha: Ai mere Rabb, mere ba'z ne ba'z ko kha liya [sakht garmi ki wajah se]; to Us ne use do saanson ki ijazat di: Sardi mein ek saans aur garmi mein ek saans. To garmi ki jo sakht tareen tum pate ho us ki garmi se hai, aur sardi ki jo sakht tareen tum pate ho us ke zamhareer [thand] se hai.'"
"120","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab garmi [sakht] ho to namaz ko thanda karo; kyunke garmi ki shiddat Jahannam ki bhaap se hai.' Aur unhon ne zikr kiya ke aag ne apne Rabb se shikayat ki, to Us ne use har saal mein do saanson ki ijazat di: Sardi mein ek saans aur garmi mein ek saans."
"121","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab garmi sakht ho jae to namaz se [Zuhr mein] thandak karo; kyunke garmi ki shiddat Jahannam ki bhaap se hai.'"
"122","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raat mein Apni namaz padhte, jabke main Aap ke aur qible ke darmiyan janaze ki tarah aade leti hoti."
"123","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne soti; mere dono paon Aap ke qible mein hote. Jab Aap sajda farmate to mujhe chhute aur main apne dono paon samet leti; jab Aap khade hote to main inhen phaila deti. Unhon ne kaha: Us din gharon mein chiragh nahin hote the."
"124","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main [qible ki taraf] aade leti soti; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz padhte jabke main Aap ke samne hoti, yahan tak ke jab witr padhne ka irada farmate to kehte: 'Hat jao.'"
"125","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Fazl gadhi par aae jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz padh rahe the. To ham ba'z saf par se guzre, phir ham utre aur use charne ke liye chhor diya, aur ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz mein dakhil hue; Aap ne ham se kuch nahin kaha."
"126","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main gadhi par sawar aaya, jabke main us din ehteelam ke qareeb tha, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Mina mein logon ke sath namaz padh rahe the. To main ba'z saf ke samne se guzra, phir main utra aur gadhi ko charne ke liye chhor diya, aur main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz mein dakhil hua; kisi ne mujh par is ka inkar nahin kiya."
"127","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna, jab muazzin kehta: Ashhadu alla ilaha illallah, to Aap kehte: 'Ashhadu alla ilaha illallah.' Jab woh kehta: Ashhadu anna Muhammadan Rasulullah, to Aap kehte: 'Wa ana [aur main bhi gawahi deta hun].' Phir khamosh rehte."
"128","[AI-translation] Isa bin Talhah (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Mu'awiyah ko Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aisi hi [hadees] bayan karte suna."
"129","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tasbeeh mardon ke liye hai aur tali bajana aurton ke liye [jab namaz mein imam ko tokna ho].'"
"130","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd Sa'idi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Banu Amr bin Auf ke paas un ke darmiyan sulah karane gae. Phir namaz ka waqt aaya; muazzin Abu Bakr ke paas aaya aur kaha: Kya tum logon ko namaz padhaoge to main iqamat kahun? Unhon ne kaha: Han. To Abu Bakr ne namaz padhai. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aae jabke log namaz mein the; Aap [safon mein se] nikalte hue yahan tak ke saf mein khade hue. To logon ne taliyan bajain, jabke Abu Bakr Apni namaz mein idhar udhar nahin dekhte the. Jab logon ne taliyan zyada bajain to unhon ne idhar dekha aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ki taraf ishara farmaya ke apni jagah thahre raho. To Abu Bakr ne apne dono hath uthae phir Allah ki hamd ki us par jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen us mein se hukm diya tha. Phir Abu Bakr peeche hate yahan tak ke saf mein barabar hue, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aage badhe aur namaz padhai. Jab [namaz se] phire to farmaya: 'Ai Abu Bakr, tumhen kis ne roka ke thahre rahte jab main ne tumhen hukm diya tha?' Abu Bakr ne kaha: Ibn Abi Quhafa ke liye [jaiz] nahin tha ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne namaz padhata. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mujhe kya hai ke main ne tumhen taliyan zyada bajate dekha! Jo apni namaz mein kisi masle se dochar ho use tasbeeh kehni chahiye; kyunke jab woh tasbeeh kehta hai to us ki taraf tawajjuh ki jati hai. Beshak tali bajana aurton ke liye hai.'"
"131","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Banu Amr bin Auf ke darmiyan sulah karane nikle; phir namaz ka waqt aaya, Bilal ne azan kahi, jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ruk gae. To Abu Bakr aage badhe aur logon ko namaz padhai. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aae aur safon mein se guzarne lage; jab Aap Abu Bakr wali saf tak pahunche to log taliyan bajane lage. Jabke Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) aise aadmi the jo namaz mein idhar udhar nahin dekhte the; jab unhon ne yeh suna to idhar dekha aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ki taraf ishara farmaya ke thahre raho. To Abu Bakr ne apna sar aasman ki taraf uthaya aur Allah Azz wa Jall ka shukr ada kiya, phir ulte qadam peeche hate, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aage badhe. Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Apni namaz se farigh hue to farmaya: 'Ai Abu Bakr, tumhen kis ne roka ke thahre rehte jab main ne tumhari taraf ishara farmaya tha?' Abu Bakr ne kaha: Ibn Abi Quhafa ke liye [jaiz] nahin tha ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne namaz padhata. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya: 'Ai logo, tumhen kya hai ke jab tumhari namaz mein koi masla pesh aaya to tum taliyan bajane lage! Beshak tali bajana aurton ke liye hai aur tasbeeh mardon ke liye; to jo apni namaz mein kisi masle se dochar ho use kehna chahiye: Subhanallah.'"
"132","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Umm Habibah bint Jahsh ko istehaza ata tha; unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak yeh sirf ek rag [ka khoon] hai, haiz nahin.' To woh ghusl kartin aur namaz padhtin. Aur ravi ne kaha: Mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: Woh har namaz ke waqt ghusl kartin aur lagan [bartan] mein baithtin to khoon us par chha jata."
"133","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umm Habibah bint Jahsh ko istehaza aaya, jabke woh [Abdur Rahman bin Auf ki zauja thin], saat saal. To unhon ne is ki shikayat Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ki. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Beshak yeh haiz nahin hai; lekin yeh ek rag [ka khoon] hai. Jab haiz aae to namaz chhor do; jab woh chali jae to ghusl karo phir namaz padho.' Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain: Woh har namaz ke liye ghusl kartin phir namaz padhtin; woh apni bahen Zainab bint Jahsh ke lagan mein baithtin yahan tak ke khoon ki surkhi pani par chha jati."
"134","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai ke Umm Habibah bint Jahsh ko saat saal istehaza aaya. To unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha aur Aap se is mein fatwa manga. Aishah kehti hain: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Yeh haiz nahin hai; yeh sirf ek rag [ka khoon] hai. To ghusl karo aur namaz padho.' Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain: Woh har namaz ke liye ghusl kartin; woh lagan mein baithtin to khoon ki surkhi pani par chha jati, phir woh nikal tin aur namaz padhtin."
"135","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Fatimah bint Abi Hubaysh ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Ya Rasulullah, beshak main pak nahin hoti; kya main namaz chhor dun? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak yeh sirf ek rag [ka khoon] hai, haiz nahin. Jab haiz aae to namaz chhor do; jab us ka andaza chala jae to apne se khoon dho lo phir namaz padho.'"
"136","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein ek aurat ko [istehaza ka] khoon kasrat se ata tha. To Umm Salamah ne us ke liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se fatwa manga. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Use un raaton aur dinon ki ginti dekhni chahiye jin mein woh mahine mein se haiz wali hoti thin, is se pehle ke use woh lage jo use laga hai; to use mahine mein se utni namaz chhorni chahiye. Phir jab woh us se aage badh jae to ghusl kare, kapde se [khoon rokne ke liye] bandhe, phir namaz padhe.' Aur Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Mujhe Malik bayan karte hain; to main Hisham ki hadees aur Nafi ki hadees leta hun. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka jawab haalat ke farq par dalalat karta hai: Jab aurat ke mahine mein se haiz ke jane mane din hon, phir use istehaza aae, jabke woh apne khoon ke tamam dinon mein ek haalat mein ho, us ka khoon juda na ho: Kabhi surkh gehra, kabhi peela halka, jabke woh ghula mila ghair juda ho, to woh un raaton aur dinon ki ginti dekhe jin mein woh us mahine mein se haiz wali hoti thin, mahine ke awwal mein hon ya wast mein ya aakhir mein; un mein namaz chhore, ehtiyatan un par ek ghadi ka izafa na kare aur jaldi mein un mein se ek ghadi ki kami na kare. Phir ghusl kare jaise haiz se pak hone par ghusl karti hai, phir namaz padhe, roza rakhe, us ka shauhar chahe to us ke paas aae, aur har namaz ke liye wuzu kare. Main us ke liye baghair us par wajib kiye pasand karta hun ke woh ek tuhr se dusre tuhr tak ghusl kare, hazir hone wali farz namaz ke liye wuzu na chhore, phir is wuzu se nawafil padhe; phir jab farz namaz hazir ho to us ke liye naya wuzu kare. Aur main us ke liye pasand karta hun ke woh apni sharmgah saaf kare, rui rakhe aur kapda bandhe, phir wuzu kare. Phir agar us ne wuzu kiya jabke khoon beh raha hai, aur woh apne dinon mein aisi hi hai, to apne wuzu par qaim rahe. Aur agar mustahaza ka khoon juda hota ho: Us ke mahine ke ba'z dinon mein surkh gehra [aur] kasrat se, aur dusre dinon mein halka thoda zardi ki taraf maail; to woh din jin mein khoon surkh gehra tha us ke haiz ke din hain, aur woh din jin mein halka peela thoda tha us ke istehaza ke din hain. To kasrat wale khoon ke jane par ghusl kare, thode khoon ke dinon mein har namaz ke liye wuzu kare, aur waisa kare jaisa dusri [pehli mustahaza] ko hukm diya gaya kare; aur in dono mein se koi ek ghadi se ehtiyat na kare. Aur aisa hi ham ko Malik ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se barabar bayan kiya. Rahi Zuhri ki hadees, to us mein koi cheez is ke khilaf nahin; us ne sirf hikayat ki ke woh aurat khud har namaz ke liye ghusl karti aur lagan mein baithti, aur hikayat nahin ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use is ka hukm diya tha. Aur Muhammad bin Idris Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Aur agar ek aurat ko ibtida mein [pehli martaba haiz] aaya aur ibtida se pehle us ke koi din nahin, phir use istehaza aaya aur khoon us par ghair juda chha gaya, to ham kahenge: Tumhare liye jaiz nahin ke apne din apni man ya bahnon ke din banao; aur namaz mein apna hukm apne nafs ke hukm ke siwa na banao. To har mahine mein se namaz utni chhoro jitni kam se kam haiza chhorti hai jo ham ne dekhi, aur woh mahine mein ek din hai, phir namaz padho."
